<section id="en-items"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Full_Item_Catalog_.2818_Items.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Full_Item_Catalog_(18_Items)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Worker_Items"></span>
<h2>Equip one worker item</h2>
<p>Each worker has <strong>one equipment slot</strong> beside clothing in Manage Workers. Click the slot, select an owned item, and replace or remove it as needed. One copy cannot equip two workers. Removing or replacing equipment returns it to inventory and removes its equipped stat bonus. Gemstone Heels use the player’s consumable stock and return there when unequipped; equipping them does not destroy the copy.</p><details><summary>Worker equipment reference</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Item</th><th scope="col">Equipped effect</th><th scope="col">Source or use</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Lucky Charm</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">+5% personal income</td><td data-label="Source or use">Rose Arthur; $500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Soothing Amulet</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">−3 work stress</td><td data-label="Source or use">Aziza; $650</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Training Manual</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">+50% work EXP</td><td data-label="Source or use">Illuminated Manuscript Room; $1, 000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Floral Hairpin</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">+3 Charisma</td><td data-label="Source or use">Rose Arthur; $500</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sturdy Boots</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">−2 work stress; +1 clients</td><td data-label="Source or use">Ben Arthur; $850</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Alluring Perfume</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">+10% personal income</td><td data-label="Source or use">VOID Consumer Fulfillment Center; $75, 000</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Client Magnet</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">+2 clients</td><td data-label="Source or use">Back-alley search; one-time reward</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Silk Uniform</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">+5 Appearance; +5 Charisma</td><td data-label="Source or use">Moth Lady’s personal reward, population 15 M+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Focus Crystal</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">+75% work EXP</td><td data-label="Source or use">Main-story progression with Blinky</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Gemstone Heels</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">+10% personal income; +5 Fame while equipped</td><td data-label="Source or use">Ben Arthur: $2, 000, 2 Gems, 2 Epic Fabrics</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Velvet Ribbon</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">+15% personal income; +3 Appearance</td><td data-label="Source or use">Christmas Claw Machine</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Zen Pendant</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">−10 work stress; +1 daily reputation</td><td data-label="Source or use">Sylwithe’s Hollow; 7 Crystals</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Golden Tongue Ring</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">+20% personal income; +2 clients</td><td data-label="Source or use">Noble Quarter heist; one-time reward</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Bardic Lyre Pin</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">+10 Fame while equipped; +10 Charisma</td><td data-label="Source or use">Bards Guild quest reward</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Crown of Devotion</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">−99 work stress; +25% work EXP; +1 daily reputation</td><td data-label="Source or use">If already owned, equip from worker inventory</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Enchantress Tiara</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">+30% personal income; +3 clients; +10 Fame while equipped</td><td data-label="Source or use">Baba Yaga encounter reward</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sirena Vibes</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">Loyalty cannot decrease; +1 Loyalty per working day; Loyalty cap 150</td><td data-label="Source or use">Shelly; 50 Sea Shells, repeatable</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pearl Necklace</th><td data-label="Equipped effect">+2 clients; ×2 personal income</td><td data-label="Source or use">Shelly; 120 Sea Shells, one purchase</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><p>A “Fame+5/+10” equipment effect raises current Fame while equipped; it is <em>not</em> an extra permanent Fame gain every day. Income and EXP percentages use their own stages, while Pearl Necklace multiplies personal pay. Ordinary worker equipment does not need to be on the player to benefit its wearer.</p>
</section>
<section id="en-visits">
<h2>Visits, Loyalty and training</h2>
<p><strong>Worker Quarters → Visit Worker</strong> lists active workers on shift who are not resting, vacationing or already visited that day. There is <strong>one ordinary visit per worker per day</strong>. Elara first needs <strong>After Hours with the Manager</strong>; Bellavia follows her current personal access progress. Raven is handled separately.</p><p>Entering a visit costs <strong>60 minutes, 60 Energy and 40 Calm</strong>. Active Time, Power and Focus potions independently reduce those to <strong>30 minutes, 30 Energy and 20 Calm</strong>, respectively. Entry commits the visit; leaving without using a session action still consumes the day’s visit. Talk, Praise, Gift and Training are each usable once inside that session.</p><p>Talk and Praise can each give a 5% special Loyalty result, a further 25% ordinary +1 result, or no direct Loyalty. Gifts follow the worker’s preferences. Session points are separate from NPC relationship points; leaving with 18–96/97–175/176–255/256+ session points grants 1/2/3/4 Loyalty, plus 1 with Trust Building. Below 18 grants none.</p><p>Training starts with Kissing and unlocks the next step after a completed training, up to eight steps. Kissing, Oral, Missionary, Cowgirl, Doggie and Special 1 raise one primary stat by 1: respectively Charisma, Intelligence, Appearance, Stamina, Ability and Dexterity; Special 2/3 each raise two distinct random primaries by 1. Training gives the player 50 Erotic Experience and worker EXP scaled by the player’s resulting experience tier. It normally adds 20 worker Stress, or 10 with Tantric Arts; overflow beyond 100 costs 2 Health per excess point. Dungeon apprentices take no training stress.</p><details><summary>Visit and training efficiency</summary><p>Intimate Communication improves Talk; worker Charisma improves Praise. Tantric Arts adds 10 base training EXP as well as reducing stress; Sensual Mastery multiplies that base by 1.5, then the result keeps 80%, with truncation. A completed matching gift upgrade then doubles it. Emotional Bonding improves training session points, Pleasure Arts adds one random primary point, and Trust Building improves a positive exit Loyalty reward.</p></details><p>For a lighter daily option, use the employee’s personal encouragement action when she is present in the business: <strong>20 minutes, once per day, +1 Loyalty up to 100 and +1 base relationship point</strong>. It is a separate action from an ordinary visit. Above 100 Loyalty is preserved rather than lowered by the ordinary gain.</p>
</section>
<section id="en-visit-reference">
<h2>Optional gift and Raven-session reference</h2>
<details><summary>Ordinary visit-gift preferences</summary><p>Favorite / normal / least-favorite gifts give 15/8/3 session points, 4–8/2–6/1–3 Loyalty while below 100, and 8/5/3 base NPC relationship points. A gift is consumed. This is the ordinary worker-visit preference list, not every other personal gift action.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Worker</th><th scope="col">Favorite</th><th scope="col">Least favorite</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Elara</th><td data-label="Favorite">Book</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Teddy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sophie</th><td data-label="Favorite">Teddy</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Wine</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Honey</th><td data-label="Favorite">Flowers</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Jewelry</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sandra</th><td data-label="Favorite">Wine</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Book</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Grace</th><td data-label="Favorite">Book</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Lingerie</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cinnamon</th><td data-label="Favorite">Chocolate</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Wine</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shadow</th><td data-label="Favorite">Jewelry</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Flowers</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Foxy</th><td data-label="Favorite">Toy</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Perfume</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Bellavia</th><td data-label="Favorite">Book</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Wine</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Valkyra</th><td data-label="Favorite">Wine</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Chocolate</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lindia</th><td data-label="Favorite">Book</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Wine</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ava &amp; Eva</th><td data-label="Favorite">Jewelry</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Book</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Gem</th><td data-label="Favorite">Gemstone Heels</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Flowers</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Jade</th><td data-label="Favorite">Jewelry</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Toy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pixie</th><td data-label="Favorite">Wine / Chocolate</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Perfume</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Brandy</th><td data-label="Favorite">Wine</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Book</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Willow</th><td data-label="Favorite">Flowers</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Jewelry</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vixen</th><td data-label="Favorite">Jewelry</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Teddy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kasumi</th><td data-label="Favorite">Flowers</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Wine</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A.R.I.A.</th><td data-label="Favorite">Teddy</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Book</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vespa</th><td data-label="Favorite">Jewelry</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Flowers / Chocolate</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Audrey</th><td data-label="Favorite">Perfume</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Teddy</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Whiskers</th><td data-label="Favorite">Toy</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Book</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ember</th><td data-label="Favorite">Gemstone Heels</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Chocolate</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Momosagi</th><td data-label="Favorite">Lingerie</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Book</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sashimi</th><td data-label="Favorite">Jewelry</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Gemstone Heels</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Maize</th><td data-label="Favorite">Chocolate</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Book</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pepper</th><td data-label="Favorite">Chocolate</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Book</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ryia</th><td data-label="Favorite">Book</td><td data-label="Least favorite">Teddy</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><details><summary>Consumables as worker gifts</summary><p>These use the session’s one Gift action and consume one item instead of activating its player buff. Effects target the worker:</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Consumable</th><th scope="col">Worker effect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Time</th><td data-label="Worker effect">+1 Dexterity</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Antidote</th><td data-label="Worker effect">Full worker Health and Stress 0</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Power</th><td data-label="Worker effect">+1 Stamina</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shield</th><td data-label="Worker effect">+1 Loyalty within the ordinary limit</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Focus</th><td data-label="Worker effect">+1 Intelligence</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Desire</th><td data-label="Worker effect">+1 Ability</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cologne</th><td data-label="Worker effect">+1 Appearance</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Luck</th><td data-label="Worker effect">+1 random primary stat</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><details><summary>Raven’s separate Dungeon sessions</summary><p>The six image-session actions need paid access, Raven recruited and not vacationing, plus the listed relationship stage. Their exact action windows are <strong>18:00–22:59 and 00:00–02:59</strong>; 23:00–23:59 is outside those two windows. Each takes 30 minutes and can repeat while requirements and resources permit. Rewards below are worker EXP / direct NPC relationship / player Erotic Experience.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Stage</th><th scope="col">Health and Energy cost, each</th><th scope="col">Rewards</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Under Her Boot</th><td data-label="Stage">Known</td><td data-label="Health and Energy cost, each">10</td><td data-label="Rewards">2 / 5 / 15</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Controlled Descent</th><td data-label="Stage">Acquaintance</td><td data-label="Health and Energy cost, each">20</td><td data-label="Rewards">4 / 10 / 25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Testing Limits</th><td data-label="Stage">Friend</td><td data-label="Health and Energy cost, each">30</td><td data-label="Rewards">6 / 20 / 35</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Whip Training</th><td data-label="Stage">Close Friend</td><td data-label="Health and Energy cost, each">40</td><td data-label="Rewards">8 / 30 / 45</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Deep Submission</th><td data-label="Stage">Crush</td><td data-label="Health and Energy cost, each">50</td><td data-label="Rewards">10 / 40 / 55</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ultimate Control</th><td data-label="Stage">Romantic</td><td data-label="Health and Energy cost, each">60</td><td data-label="Rewards">12 / 50 / 60</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Her separate Get Punished action requires 1000 relationship points, takes 45 minutes and 60 Energy, and is limited to once per day. It gives 15 worker EXP, 40 base relationship points and 80 player Erotic Experience, subject to its personal presence and content requirements.</p></details>
</section>
<section id="en-gift-upgrades"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Upgrade_Training_plots"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Special_Gifts"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Unlocking_Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Training_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Gift"></span>
<h2>Permanent gift-training upgrades</h2>
<p>There are <strong>66 completed one-time upgrades</strong> across 29 workers; Raven has no ordinary gift-training upgrade. Be <strong>In Love</strong>, finish the worker’s relevant personal prerequisites, keep her off vacation, and carry the matching crafted gift. The named action appears at its specified location and time. It consumes <strong>one gift</strong> and permanently upgrades that training.</p><p>A matching upgraded training gives <strong>×2 worker EXP</strong>. Every completed upgrade for that employee also adds <strong>+50% daily personal income</strong>, summed before multiplying: one/two/three upgrades give×1.5/×2/×2.5, not repeated×1.5 compounding. This income bonus is independent of which training you select on later visits.</p><details><summary>Craft the six gifts</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Gift</th><th scope="col">Crafter</th><th scope="col">Cost</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Void-Kissed Charm</th><td data-label="Crafter">Sabbath</td><td data-label="Cost">3 Void-Touched Fangs +5 Abyssal Eyes +2 Soul Threads</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Golden Pulse Bracelet</th><td data-label="Crafter">Rose Arthur</td><td data-label="Cost">5 Gilded Hearts +2 Mutagenic Ichors +3 Shimmering Heartscales</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Abyssal Looking Glass</th><td data-label="Crafter">Silas</td><td data-label="Cost">5 Abyssal Eyes +2 Shimmering Heartscales +3 Soul Threads</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Moonfang Leather Choker</th><td data-label="Crafter">Ben Arthur</td><td data-label="Cost">4 Void-Touched Fangs +4 Mutagenic Ichors +5 Leather</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hexbound Rose Sachet</th><td data-label="Crafter">Rose Arthur</td><td data-label="Cost">3 Void-Touched Fangs +4 Mutagenic Ichors +3 Soul Threads</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Prismatic Spell Brooch</th><td data-label="Crafter">Aziza</td><td data-label="Cost">2 Soul Threads +4 Shimmering Heartscales +4 Gilded Hearts</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>The materials are Infinity Dungeon trophies, plus Leather for the choker. Crafting adds no time charge and allows up to 999 trades per crafter action per day, provided you have the materials. Crafters use their normal location schedules. Each gift is used 11 times in the complete 66-upgrade set.</p></details><details><summary>Full 66-upgrade location and gift checklist</summary><p>The table is an access checklist, with no scene outcomes. Hours describe the action window; personal plot and NPC-presence conditions may narrow it further. Follow the worker’s current Objectives if the action is still absent despite having the gift and relationship stage.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Worker</th><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Hours</th><th scope="col">Training improved</th><th scope="col">Gift consumed</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Elara</th><td data-label="Action">A Gift Without Obligation</td><td data-label="Location">Elara's Office</td><td data-label="Hours">Any time</td><td data-label="Training improved">Cowgirl</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Void-Kissed Charm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Elara</th><td data-label="Action">What the Ledgers Leave Out</td><td data-label="Location">Elara's Office</td><td data-label="Hours">Any time</td><td data-label="Training improved">Oral</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Golden Pulse Bracelet</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sophie</th><td data-label="Action">The Woman in the Glass</td><td data-label="Location">Central Plaza</td><td data-label="Hours">Any time</td><td data-label="Training improved">Cowgirl</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Abyssal Looking Glass</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sophie</th><td data-label="Action">Mine to Give</td><td data-label="Location">Worker Quarters</td><td data-label="Hours">Any time</td><td data-label="Training improved">Oral</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Moonfang Leather Choker</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">S