><td data-label="Gift consumed">Hexbound Rose Sachet</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Kasumi</th><td data-label="Action">The Future Can Wait</td><td data-label="Location">The Bar</td><td data-label="Hours">15:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Oral</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Prismatic Spell Brooch</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A.R.I.A.</th><td data-label="Action">What the Locks Could Not Own</td><td data-label="Location">Calibration Room</td><td data-label="Hours">11:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Doggie</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Void-Kissed Charm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A.R.I.A.</th><td data-label="Action">A Pulse She Authored</td><td data-label="Location">Calibration Room</td><td data-label="Hours">11:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Oral</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Golden Pulse Bracelet</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vespa</th><td data-label="Action">No Witness Required</td><td data-label="Location">Vespa's Room</td><td data-label="Hours">09:00–14:00; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Missionary</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Abyssal Looking Glass</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vespa</th><td data-label="Action">A Bow Without a Throne</td><td data-label="Location">Vespa's Room</td><td data-label="Hours">09:00–14:00; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Oral</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Moonfang Leather Choker</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Audrey</th><td data-label="Action">Roots That Can Leave</td><td data-label="Location">Garden</td><td data-label="Hours">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Cowgirl</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Hexbound Rose Sachet</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Audrey</th><td data-label="Action">One Light, Every Color</td><td data-label="Location">Garden</td><td data-label="Hours">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Oral</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Prismatic Spell Brooch</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Audrey</th><td data-label="Action">The Shape in the Dark</td><td data-label="Location">Garden</td><td data-label="Hours">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Doggie</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Void-Kissed Charm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Whiskers</th><td data-label="Action">The High Ground Is Hers</td><td data-label="Location">Whiskers' Room</td><td data-label="Hours">00:00–10:00; 16:00–18:00; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Cowgirl</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Golden Pulse Bracelet</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Whiskers</th><td data-label="Action">The Shape Is Hers</td><td data-label="Location">Whiskers' Room</td><td data-label="Hours">00:00–10:00; 16:00–18:00; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Missionary</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Abyssal Looking Glass</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Whiskers</th><td data-label="Action">What She Looks Back For</td><td data-label="Location">Whiskers' Room</td><td data-label="Hours">00:00–10:00; 16:00–18:00; 20:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Special 3</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Void-Kissed Charm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ember</th><td data-label="Action">No Throne Requires This</td><td data-label="Location">Ember's Lair</td><td data-label="Hours">Any time</td><td data-label="Training improved">Oral</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Moonfang Leather Choker</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ember</th><td data-label="Action">The Gate She Opens</td><td data-label="Location">Ember's Lair</td><td data-label="Hours">Any time</td><td data-label="Training improved">Doggie</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Prismatic Spell Brooch</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Momosagi</th><td data-label="Action">One Heart, Two Voices</td><td data-label="Location">Master Bedroom</td><td data-label="Hours">21:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Cowgirl</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Golden Pulse Bracelet</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Momosagi</th><td data-label="Action">A Name She Gives You</td><td data-label="Location">Master Bedroom</td><td data-label="Hours">21:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Oral</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Abyssal Looking Glass</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sashimi</th><td data-label="Action">No Debt in the Current</td><td data-label="Location">Pool</td><td data-label="Hours">15:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Oral</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Hexbound Rose Sachet</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Sashimi</th><td data-label="Action">The Woman in Every Tide</td><td data-label="Location">Pool</td><td data-label="Hours">15:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Cowgirl</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Abyssal Looking Glass</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Maize</th><td data-label="Action">The Strength to Be Held</td><td data-label="Location">Brothel Dungeon</td><td data-label="Hours">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Cowgirl</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Moonfang Leather Choker</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Maize</th><td data-label="Action">Every Part of Maize</td><td data-label="Location">Brothel Dungeon</td><td data-label="Hours">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Oral</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Hexbound Rose Sachet</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pepper</th><td data-label="Action">The Things Pepper Knows</td><td data-label="Location">Master Bedroom</td><td data-label="Hours">05:00–09:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Doggie</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Prismatic Spell Brooch</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pepper</th><td data-label="Action">The Life Pepper Chose</td><td data-label="Location">Master Bedroom</td><td data-label="Hours">05:00–09:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Oral</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Void-Kissed Charm</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ryia</th><td data-label="Action">The Woman in Her Own Story</td><td data-label="Location">Ryia's Room</td><td data-label="Hours">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Special 3</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Abyssal Looking Glass</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ryia</th><td data-label="Action">No Footnote Needed</td><td data-label="Location">Ryia's Room</td><td data-label="Hours">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Cowgirl</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Moonfang Leather Choker</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Ryia</th><td data-label="Action">A Pleasure Entirely Hers</td><td data-label="Location">Ryia's Room</td><td data-label="Hours">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Training improved">Special 1</td><td data-label="Gift consumed">Hexbound Rose Sachet</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details>
</section>
<section id="en-expansion">
<h2>Construction, Promotion and Decor</h2>
<p>Gastoff’s commissions at the Blacksmith are separate from bedroom upgrades. Each is a one-time payment; the completed project opens immediately. In the table, <strong>C/R/E quantities must be paid separately in each of Materials, Fabrics and Ingredients</strong>. Cell 1 comes with the corridor and is reserved for Bobo; the six capturable monsters can fill cells 2–7.</p><details><summary>All available business commissions</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Project</th><th scope="col">Gold</th><th scope="col">Minutes</th><th scope="col">Each resource: C/R/E</th><th scope="col">Business rank</th><th scope="col">Other requirement</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Courtyard</th><td data-label="Gold">30, 000</td><td data-label="Minutes">180</td><td data-label="Each resource: C/R/E">0/0/10</td><td data-label="Business rank">5+</td><td data-label="Other requirement">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pool</th><td data-label="Gold">200, 000</td><td data-label="Minutes">180</td><td data-label="Each resource: C/R/E">0/0/25</td><td data-label="Business rank">6+</td><td data-label="Other requirement">Courtyard</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Menagerie</th><td data-label="Gold">2, 000, 000</td><td data-label="Minutes">200</td><td data-label="Each resource: C/R/E">0/0/50</td><td data-label="Business rank">9+</td><td data-label="Other requirement">Courtyard</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Training Room</th><td data-label="Gold">10, 000, 000</td><td data-label="Minutes">240</td><td data-label="Each resource: C/R/E">500/200/75</td><td data-label="Business rank">9+</td><td data-label="Other requirement">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cell Corridor + Cell 1</th><td data-label="Gold">1, 000, 000</td><td data-label="Minutes">180</td><td data-label="Each resource: C/R/E">0/35/0</td><td data-label="Business rank">8+</td><td data-label="Other requirement">Raven active worker; Paid content</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cell 2</th><td data-label="Gold">1, 500, 000</td><td data-label="Minutes">180</td><td data-label="Each resource: C/R/E">0/50/0</td><td data-label="Business rank">8+</td><td data-label="Other requirement">Cell Corridor; Paid content</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cell 3</th><td data-label="Gold">2, 000, 000</td><td data-label="Minutes">180</td><td data-label="Each resource: C/R/E">0/0/25</td><td data-label="Business rank">8+</td><td data-label="Other requirement">Cell 2; Paid content</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cell 4</th><td data-label="Gold">2, 500, 000</td><td data-label="Minutes">180</td><td data-label="Each resource: C/R/E">0/0/30</td><td data-label="Business rank">8+</td><td data-label="Other requirement">Cell 3; Paid content</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cell 5</th><td data-label="Gold">3, 000, 000</td><td data-label="Minutes">180</td><td data-label="Each resource: C/R/E">0/0/35</td><td data-label="Business rank">8+</td><td data-label="Other requirement">Cell 4; Paid content</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cell 6</th><td data-label="Gold">3, 500, 000</td><td data-label="Minutes">180</td><td data-label="Each resource: C/R/E">0/0/40</td><td data-label="Business rank">8+</td><td data-label="Other requirement">Cell 5; Paid content</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cell 7</th><td data-label="Gold">4, 000, 000</td><td data-label="Minutes">180</td><td data-label="Each resource: C/R/E">0/0/45</td><td data-label="Business rank">8+</td><td data-label="Other requirement">Cell 6; Paid content</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><p>Courtyard, Pool, Menagerie and Training Room each add 1 stored Decor. Effective Decor also includes equipped maid bonuses, Arcane apprentices and an owned Cthulhu’s Head. It rolls separate 0–5×level% bonuses for building income and reputation. It starts at 0.</p><p>Promotion starts at 1. Above 1 it gives a building-wide 0–level extra-client pool and a separate 0–10×level% reputation roll. Menagerie apprentices, equipment and specified recruitment rewards add to it; an active Vespa and an owned Cthulhu’s Head also add 1 effective level each. These paid promotions are one-time +1 sources:</p><details><summary>Town promotion actions</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Payment and condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Kalb: Ask Kalb to Spread the Word</th><td data-label="Payment and condition">$500; Sophie recruited; Kalb Friend</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Aziza: Ask Aziza to Spread the Word</th><td data-label="Payment and condition">$500; Aziza Close Friend</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">King: Request Royal Proclamation</th><td data-label="Payment and condition">$2, 000; business reputation 2+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Silas: Ask Silas to Spread the Word</th><td data-label="Payment and condition">$1, 000; Jade active</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Arestes: Request Guild Protection</th><td data-label="Payment and condition">$10, 000; Thieves Guild reputation 180+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Vespa: Letter of Introduction</th><td data-label="Payment and condition">30 min, 3 Crystals; Close Friend; one-time</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><p>The built Training Room offers player Strength, Stamina, Ability or Mystic training for <strong>$80, 000, 50 Energy and 50 Calm</strong> per session. Base time is 120 min, dropping to 100 min with at least 2 apprentices; gains are 2–5 without apprentices, 2–6 with 1–2, 3–7 with 3. Building permits basic training; assigning its apprentices additionally needs Muramasa’s completed <strong>A Wider Ring</strong> recruitment.</p>
</section>
<section id="en-medicine"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Willow_and_the_Brothel_Medicine_Level"></span>
<h2>Willow’s Medicine progression</h2>
<p>After Willow joins, her Infirmary supports the whole roster. Ten special ingredient hand-ins each add <strong>1 permanent business Medicine level</strong>. Carry the found ingredient and use its personal follow-up with Willow; finding it alone is not the level-up. Medicine strengthens Infirmary apprentices’ work-stress prevention, rather than improving every medicine consumable.</p><details><summary>Ten ingredient sources</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Ingredient</th><th scope="col">Source / condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Silvervein Moss</th><td data-label="Source / condition">Present Mountain hike; 1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Hushbell Seeds</th><td data-label="Source / condition">Mary Ann’s Butterfly Pavilion personal follow-up</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Emberlace Root</th><td data-label="Source / condition">Haunted Mansion Greenhouse; Halloween access</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cloudmilk Spores</th><td data-label="Source / condition">Explore Back Alleys; 1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tideglass Kelp</th><td data-label="Source / condition">Future Surplus Distribution Scavenge; 1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Velvetwake Buds</th><td data-label="Source / condition">Venus Flytrap regular enemy drop; 1%, distinct from the boss</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rainheart Cuttings</th><td data-label="Source / condition">Audrey’s Garden follow-up at In Love</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Stillthorn Sprig</th><td data-label="Source / condition">Forage Ingredients at Hunting Grounds; 1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dawnthread Saffron</th><td data-label="Source / condition">Noble Quarter Break &amp; Enter departure; 1%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Memorymint Runners</th><td data-label="Source / condition">Terra’s Plant Dome personal follow-up</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><p>Use <a href="character-willow.html">Willow’s guide</a> for the personal hand-in sequence and <a href="game-systems-haunted-mansion.html">Haunted Mansion</a> for the seasonal Greenhouse. Infirmary apprentices guarantee at least 1 prevented incoming work-stress point each; Medicine gives further per-point rolls. It does not erase existing Stress.</p>
</section>
<section id="en-monsters"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Consumables_for_Monster_Management"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Monster_Training_Stat_Map"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Managing_Monster_Girls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Monster_Stats_.280.E2.80.93100.2C_but_starting_values_are_single_digits.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Monster_Stats_(0–100,_but_starting_values_are_single_digits)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Monster_Girls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Capturing_Monster_Girls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Building_the_Cell_Corridor_.28and_the_Cells.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Building_the_Cell_Corridor_(and_the_Cells)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Monster_Girls_.28Cell_Corridor.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Monster_Girls_(Cell_Corridor)"></span>
<h2>Cell Corridor and captured monsters</h2>
<p>After business rank 8 and Raven’s recruitment, commission the Cell Corridor and at least Cell 2. Bobo joins through her own dungeon scenario chain and uses Cell 1. Jelly, Myriss, Arachne, Melanthe, Bessie and Daphne are recruited from their corresponding <strong>normal-dungeon</strong> enemies. Infinity fights do not advance these capture counters.</p><p>The first five defeats of each species do not roll capture; later defeats use a rising chance plus raw player Taming, capped at 100%. The sixth defeat begins at 20%+Taming, then rises 10 percentage points per additional defeat. A successful surrender still needs a free built cell; otherwise she leaves. You may choose whether to recruit when offered.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Monster</th><th scope="col">Route</th><th scope="col">Starting Tamed</th><th scope="col">Food per Feed</th><th scope="col">Daily Tamed loss</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Bobo</th><td data-label="Route">Scripted dungeon route</td><td data-label="Starting Tamed">50</td><td data-label="Food per Feed">3</td><td data-label="Daily Tamed loss">5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Jelly</th><td data-label="Route">Regular Jelly encounters</td><td data-label="Starting Tamed">70</td><td data-label="Food per Feed">2</td><td data-label="Daily Tamed loss">3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Myriss</th><td data-label="Route">Regular Dark Elf Warrior encounters</td><td data-label="Starting Tamed">30</td><td data-label="Food per Feed">5</td><td data-label="Daily Tamed loss">6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Arachne</th><td data-label="Route">Regular Arachne encounters</td><td data-label="Starting Tamed">35</td><td data-label="Food per Feed">5</td><td data-label="Daily Tamed loss">6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Melanthe</th><td data-label="Route">Regular Melanthe encounters</td><td data-label="Starting Tamed">20</td><td data-label="Food per Feed">7</td><td data-label="Daily Tamed loss">7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Bessie</th><td data-label="Route">Regular Bessie encounters</td><td data-label="Starting Tamed">25</td><td data-label="Food per Feed">8</td><td data-label="Daily Tamed loss">6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Daphne</th><td data-label="Route">Regular Daphne encounters</td><td data-label="Starting Tamed">50</td><td data-label="Food per Feed">3</td><td data-label="Daily Tamed loss">4</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Use <strong>Manage Monsters</strong> for stats and EXP upgrades, or <strong>Tame Monsters</strong> for a session. Resting monsters and monsters already visited that day are unavailable until eligible again. Each session permits Feed, Discipline, Teach and Training once each. Feed costs the listed food and adds 10 Tamed. Teach and Training require Tamed 30. Tamed loss is a fixed number of points per day, not that percentage of the remaining meter; reaching 30 is the daily-work threshold.</p><details><summary>Discipline tool reference</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Tool</th><th scope="col">Tamed</th><th scope="col">Stress</th><th scope="col">Health</th><th scope="col">EXP</th><th scope="col">Chance +1 player Taming</th><th scope="col">Tamed cap</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Whip</th><td data-label="Tamed">+15</td><td data-label="Stress">+0</td><td data-label="Health">+0</td><td data-label="EXP">+0</td><td data-label="Chance +1 player Taming">3%</td><td data-label="Tamed cap">100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Rope</th><td data-label="Tamed">+10</td><td data-label="Stress">-20</td><td data-label="Health">+0</td><td data-label="EXP">+0</td><td data-label="Chance +1 player Taming">2%</td><td data-label="Tamed cap">100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Moonpetal Tincture</th><td data-label="Tamed">+0</td><td data-label="Stress">-25</td><td data-label="Health">+50</td><td data-label="EXP">+0</td><td data-label="Chance +1 player Taming">5%</td><td data-label="Tamed cap">100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shackles</th><td data-label="Tamed">+10</td><td data-label="Stress">+10</td><td data-label="Health">+0</td><td data-label="EXP">+25</td><td data-label="Chance +1 player Taming">2%</td><td data-label="Tamed cap">100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Thorns</th><td data-label="Tamed">+30</td><td data-label="Stress">+15</td><td data-label="Health">+0</td><td data-label="EXP">+0</td><td data-label="Chance +1 player Taming">3%</td><td data-label="Tamed cap">100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Claw</th><td data-label="Tamed">+10</td><td data-label="Stress">+0</td><td data-label="Health">+0</td><td data-label="EXP">+0</td><td data-label="Chance +1 player Taming">2%</td><td data-label="Tamed cap">150</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Whip comes from Bobo’s recruitment route; Rope from Marina’s personal route; Moonpetal Tincture from Bobo/Willow’s linked follow-up; Shackles from Becky’s route; Thorns from the Fighters Guild contract reward; Claw costs 50 Sea Shells at Shelly. The tool is used as session equipment, not consumed per Discipline.</p></details><p>Monster training uses an eight-step ladder: Aura, Cunning, Allure, Vitality, Ability and Agility are the first six focused gains; the last two steps each raise two distinct random primaries. EXP is a roll from 1 to player Taming plus a roll from 1 to monster Cunning. Their primary cap is 100, and each upgrade costs the next stat value in EXP.</p><p>At Tamed 30 or more, monsters roll pay separately per client; that income is added after normal tax/upkeep and Ballroom fees. Each client adds 2 mess. Stress above 75 begins 3 rest days, with no work on the completion day. Wort’s <strong>Smelling Salts</strong> reduces captured monsters’ Stress by 10; <strong>Monster Tonic</strong> clears the daily taming lock. Each has its own once-daily use, costs 1 Dragon Coin at Wort, and becomes available through the built corridor’s dungeon content.</p>
</section>
<section id="en-kitchen"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Maid_Group_Interactions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Actions_at_the_Kitchen"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Unlocking_the_Kitchen"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Cleanliness_.288_tiers.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Cleanliness_(8_tiers)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Maids_.28Cleaning_System.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Maids_(Cleaning_System)"></span>
<h2>Kitchen, recovery and cleaning actions</h2>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Cost / limit</th><th scope="col">Result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Clean Establishment, West Hallway</th><td data-label="Cost / limit">120 min, 25 Energy, 10 Calm</td><td data-label="Result">+20 cleanliness, cap 100</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cook for Rose &amp; Thorn, Kitchen</th><td data-label="Cost / limit">60 min, 20 Energy, 5 Common+1 Rare Ingredients; once/day</td><td data-label="Result">Food=5+floor(raw Cooking÷10)+3 per Kitchen apprentice</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Cook a Hearty Feast, Kitchen</th><td data-label="Cost / limit">60 min; Master Chef and effective Cooking 50+; once/day; 1 Epic Ingredient per recruited living worker</td><td data-label="Result">Each recipient: +1 Loyalty while below 100 and −5 Stress, minimum 0; includes inactive and away recruits</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Room Service, Master Bedroom</th><td data-label="Cost / limit">120 min base;−10 min per Kitchen apprentice</td><td data-label="Result">+50 Energy,+50 Calm,+40 Health,+20 Satiation; +10 to each per Kitchen apprentice</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Purchase Antidote, Nurse’s Room</th><td data-label="Cost / limit">$300 and 1 Epic Ingredient</td><td data-label="Result">One Antidote</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Poppy arrives at business rank 4; revisit the Entrance to complete her arrival and open the Kitchen. The feast quote scales with everyone served, including vacationing and inactive recruits: a smaller active roster does not reduce its bill. It preserves an existing Loyalty buffer above 100. Room Service is recovery up to your resource maxima, not a permanent maximum increase.</p><p>The maids are Violet, Mandarin, Lychee, Lime, Rain and Onyx. They are separately recruited and level through cleaning EXP, with one equipment slot at levels 1–3 and two at 4–6. Their daily team contribution does not require the player to stand in Maids Quarters at their appearance hour. See <a href="game-systems-maid-system.html">Maid System</a> for acquisition, equipment and growth.</p>
</section>
<section id="en-bookings">
<h2>Optional private bookings and daily events</h2>
<p><strong>Receive a Client</strong> is a separate once-daily Entrance action at business reputation <strong>3+</strong>, in Brothel mode with the relevant NTS preference enabled. It requires an available worker, or an eligible monster with Tamed 30+. Normal workers must be on shift, healthy, active, not resting, not away and not the Ballroom trainee. The selection applies the client’s restrictions automatically.</p><p>Review the offered fee and select a worker or decline. A completed booking takes <strong>30 minutes</strong>; declining or an unwilling result takes <strong>10 minutes</strong>. The receipt pays directly to Wealth and adds its reputation immediately, separately from the business-report collection. Worker Stress, Loyalty/Tamed and EXP consequences are listed on the receipt. A monster booking is not an ordinary taming visit and does not reset its personal taming cooldown.</p><p>Ordinary daily events need no manual booking. Their effects may target one worker or the building, reward EXP or Fame, change resources, or block reputation. Security helps the success roll, but events still test different attributes. A worker’s Fame and training upgrades do not protect against a targeted income×0 outcome. Hotel events use their own pool; they are not identical scene copies.</p>
</section>
<section id="en-priorities">
<h2>Practical priorities and related guides</h2>
<ol><li>Recruit a maid early and keep cleanliness in a useful band before adding many extra-client bonuses. The top band 90–100 improves pay maximum and reputation; cleanliness 0 does not force all pay to zero.</li><li>Use early worker EXP on balanced Appearance/Charisma, Ability, and enough Stamina/Intelligence for sustainable growth. Use the displayed innate passive as a small specialization, not as a replacement for stats.</li><li>Keep Loyalty away from the refusal zone. Encouragement, visits, equipment and later vacations serve different time and income budgets.</li><li>Assign Office apprentices for growth, Infirmary/Dungeon for protection, and VIP/Ballroom when you can afford their cleaning or opportunity costs.</li><li>Build toward reputation-gated service hosts and facilities. Leave expensive MAX fittings and the 66 gift upgrades as long-term goals rather than prerequisites to a functioning business.</li></ol><p>Continue with <a href="game-systems-brothel-stats-and-calculations.html">Stats and Calculations</a>, <a href="game-systems-maid-system.html">Maid System</a>, <a href="game-systems-sirena-isle-resort.html">Sirena Isle Resort</a>, <a href="character-gastoff.html">Gastoff</a>, <a href="character-fernando.html">Fernando</a>, and the <a href="game-systems-investment-system.html">Investment System</a>.</p>
</section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Getting_Started_.E2.80.94_Early_Game_Priorities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Getting_Started_—_Early_Game_Priorities"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-How_Plots_Fire"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Raven-Specific"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Pepper.27s_Integration_Plots"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Pepper's_Integration_Plots"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sashimi_Questline"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sherry_Integration"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Management_.26_Setup_Plots"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Management_&amp;_Setup_Plots"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Arrival_.26_Recruitment_Plots"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Arrival_&amp;_Recruitment_Plots"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Brothel_Plots"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Christmas_Wreath"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Patreon_Master"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Two_Optional_Income_Bonuses"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Daily_Report"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Example_Event_Spreads"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Outcomes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Success_Calculation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Gating_Conditions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Selection_Process"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Event_Categories"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Events"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Daily_Cycle"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Operations"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Elara.27s_Passive_Roles"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Elara's_Passive_Roles"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Available_Actions_in_the_Office"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Elara.27s_Office_.E2.80.94_The_Management_Hub"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Elara's_Office_—_The_Management_Hub"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Brothel_Decor_Level"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Brothel_Promotion_Level"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Reputation_.2820.2B_levels.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Reputation_(20+_levels)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Brothel_Systems"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Strategic_Notes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Report_Integration"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Taming_Session_Actions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Work_Mechanics_.28Tamed_.E2.89.A5_30.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Work_Mechanics_(Tamed_≥_30)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Tamed_Meter_.E2.80.94_The_Core_Mechanic"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Tamed_Meter_—_The_Core_Mechanic"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Raven.27s_Sessions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Raven's_Sessions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Exit"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Training"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Praise"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Session_Menu"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Availability_Rules_.26_Visit_Costs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Availability_Rules_&amp;_Visit_Costs"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Upkeep"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Full_Skill_Library"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-How_Skills_Work"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Skills_System"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Stress.2FHealth_at_a_Glance"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Stress/Health_at_a_Glance"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-High-Loyalty_Bonus"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Refuse-to-Work_.28Low_Loyalty_Strike.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Refuse-to-Work_(Low_Loyalty_Strike)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sick_Rest_.28Health.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Sick_Rest_(Health)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Exhausted_Rest_.28Stress.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Exhausted_Rest_(Stress)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Stat_Strategy_Summary"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Fame_.28not_directly_trainable.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Fame_(not_directly_trainable)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Charisma"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Appearance"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Ability"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Dexterity"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Intelligence"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Stamina"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-What_Each_Primary_Stat_Actually_Does"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Gastoff.27s_Commissions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Gastoff's_Commissions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Courtyard_Outside_Hub"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_West_Hallway_Hub"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Entering_the_Brothel"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Navigating_the_Rose_.26_Thorn"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Navigating_the_Rose_&amp;_Thorn"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Hotel_Operation_Mode_.28Alternative.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Hotel_Operation_Mode_(Alternative)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span>
<h2>开始经营玫瑰与荆棘</h2>
<p><strong>玫瑰与荆棘</strong>位于<strong>中世纪 → 国王领地</strong>。先沿国王早期的物资问题完成Wilfred的送货，再于<strong>10:00–16:59</strong>回到王座厅，触发<strong>王室任命</strong>即可取得经营权，同时开放Elara的办公室、主卧并招募Elara，不需要另花现金购买整栋建筑。</p><p>随后进入Elara的办公室，完成<strong>确立经营模式</strong>，在<strong>青楼</strong>和<strong>酒店</strong>之间作一次性选择。两种模式共用员工、卧室、收入、清洁度和声誉的核心系统，但每日事件池、呈现方式及部分检定不同，酒店也没有接待客户操作。两者通用的说明，下文会直接称「玫瑰与荆棘」。</p><ol><li>到<strong>员工宿舍 → 管理员工</strong>查看压力、生命、忠诚度、装备及可用经验。</li><li>打开<strong>管理房间</strong>处理卧室、学徒岗位，以及后续的休假。</li><li>度过一个游戏日，再到Elara的办公室选择<strong>获取营业报告</strong>，查看已结束日期并收取待领收益。</li><li>让清洁能力跟上客户增长。招募女仆、合理安排岗位，必要时亲自清洁。</li></ol><p>本页侧重解锁与日常操作。工资、声誉、清洁和税费的完整公式见<a href="game-systems-brothel-stats-and-calculations.html">青楼属性与计算</a>。</p>
</section>
<section id="zh-daily-checks">
<h2>日常管理顺序</h2>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">状态</th><th scope="col">含义</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">工作中</th><td data-label="含义">照常产生客户、工资、工作经验、压力、名气判定及脏乱</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">休息／病休</th><td data-label="含义">不工作，休完当天也没有普通工资</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">拒绝工作</th><td data-label="含义">忠诚度低于30时，按个人概率发生</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">舞厅学员</th><td data-label="含义">训练替代客户工作，全店声誉+10%，扣普通净利15%费用</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">休假中</th><td data-label="含义">不普通工作，逐日恢复并可积累至150忠诚度</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><strong>工作后压力超过75</strong>会开始休息2天；若未先触发疲惫，生命为0则病休4天，Willow启用时为3天。休完会补满生命并清掉压力，但要到后续报告日才恢复工作。忠诚度低于30可能拒绝工作，高于80可能给个人奖励；恰好30或80都不跨过门槛。</p><p>看见某天没收入时，先查这些状态。工作时段决定普通探访和私人预约的可用性，经营日报不会逐小时模拟客户。宜经常查看和收取报告；补算使用结算时的名单与岗位，而不是过去每天的历史快照。</p>
</section>
<section id="zh-navigation">
<h2>找到需要的房间</h2>
<div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">枢纽</th><th scope="col">实用路线与操作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">入口</th><td data-label="实用路线与操作">通往Elara的办公室、主卧、员工宿舍、西走廊及已开放服务房间</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">西走廊</th><td data-label="实用路线与操作">通往奥术房、厨房、庭院、训练室及其他已开放房间；可亲自清洁</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">庭院</th><td data-label="实用路线与操作">通往水池、珍兽苑与花园</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">上层</th><td data-label="实用路线与操作">通往VIP休息室、Vespa的房间及相关专属房间</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">护士室</th><td data-label="实用路线与操作">个人进度允许时通往地窖</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">地牢</th><td data-label="实用路线与操作">建好后通往牢房走廊</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">员工宿舍</th><td data-label="实用路线与操作">管理、探访；招募后通往Ryia的房间</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>能走进去的场景，与「管理房间」里的学徒格子，是相关但不同的操作入口。许多门由招募或个人进度开放：Vixen或Vespa加入后可到上层；Audrey或A.R.I.A.可开放花园；Foxy和Ryia的房间跟随各自招募，Cinnamon则需完成表演室招募。看不到门时，先查该角色当前目标，不必盲买其他卧室升级。</p><p>密室属于Azariel的兑换码内容。门上的<strong>调查奇怪的门</strong>可打开兑换码输入；普通经营发展不会自动开放密室。</p>
</section>
<section id="zh-workers"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three-Girl_Worker_Bonding"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Selection_Methods"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Non-Worker_Residents"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Visitable_Workers"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Workers_Interactions"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Manage_Workers_Screen"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Starting_Skills_by_Worker_.2830_Recruitable_Workers.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Starting_Skills_by_Worker_(30_Recruitable_Workers)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Status_.E2.80.94_Rest.2C_Sickness.2C_and_Strikes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Status_—_Rest,_Sickness,_and_Strikes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Loyalty"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Data_Structure"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Workers"></span>
<h2>30名员工及固有被动</h2>
<p>招募跟随各自个人进度，并不是一个统一付费招聘菜单。Ava &amp; Eva共用一个员工名额。下表给出推进方向与普通工作时段，结束小时不包含在内，跨夜时段延续到次日。Raven使用自己的会话，不进入普通探访名单。</p><details><summary>展开员工、时段与招募方向</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">员工</th><th scope="col">普通工作时段</th><th scope="col">固有被动</th><th scope="col">推进方向</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-elara.html">Elara</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">助理</td><td data-label="推进方向">王室任命</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-sophie.html">Sophie</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">12:00–20:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">忠诚之心</td><td data-label="推进方向">大集市后巷的救助</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-honey.html">Honey</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">组织者</td><td data-label="推进方向">乡间农场的个人路线</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-sandra.html">Sandra</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">16:00–24:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">表演大师</td><td data-label="推进方向">吟游诗人公会的个人路线</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-grace.html">Grace</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">14:00–22:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">冥想</td><td data-label="推进方向">Grace与Sashina的个人目标；经营声誉5+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-cinnamon.html">Cinnamon</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">15:00–23:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">杂技</td><td data-label="推进方向">完成个人路线并建表演室；需珍兽苑</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-raven.html">Raven</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">18:00–02:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">地牢主宰</td><td data-label="推进方向">地下城20层遭遇</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-shadow.html">Shadow</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">20:00–04:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">扒窃</td><td data-label="推进方向">盗贼公会个人安排；公会声誉120+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-foxy.html">Foxy</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">19:00–03:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">快速学习</td><td data-label="推进方向">森林空地的个人路线</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-bellavia.html">Bellavia</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">21:00–04:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">吸吮</td><td data-label="推进方向">按当前个人目标推进</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-valkyra.html">Valkyra</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">13:00–21:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">保镖</td><td data-label="推进方向">地下城30层遭遇</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-lindia.html">Lindia</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">12:00–20:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">完美记忆</td><td data-label="推进方向">地下城7层遭遇</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-ava-and-eva.html">Ava &amp; Eva</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">12:00–24:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">天生丽质</td><td data-label="推进方向">Vixen已招募、经营声誉14+后回访入口</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-gem.html">Gem</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">采矿</td><td data-label="推进方向">完成Gem与Lyra相关目标及员工宿舍的合约</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-jade.html">Jade</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">08:00–16:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">会计</td><td data-label="推进方向">地下城交易或后巷的独立机会</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-pixie.html">Pixie</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">07:00–23:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">快速学习</td><td data-label="推进方向">完成她的地下城遭遇路线及后续重逢</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-brandy.html">Brandy</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">18:00–02:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">活跃气氛</td><td data-label="推进方向">个人招募谈心；经营声誉8+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-willow.html">Willow</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">治疗师</td><td data-label="推进方向">后巷初见及治疗合作路线</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-vixen.html">Vixen</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">11:00–18:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">迷人个性</td><td data-label="推进方向">个人合作路线；经营声誉10+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-kasumi.html">Kasumi</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">14:00–20:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">神谕者</td><td data-label="推进方向">个人路线从经营声誉6起，后续推进至10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A.R.I.A.</th><td data-label="普通工作时段">20:00–04:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">自适应学习</td><td data-label="推进方向">地下城45层相关进度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-vespa.html">Vespa</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">19:00–01:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">女王</td><td data-label="推进方向">王庭目标链，后段需经营声誉18+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-audrey.html">Audrey</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">园艺师</td><td data-label="推进方向">地下城35层遭遇</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-whiskers.html">Whiskers</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">20:00–04:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">专注</td><td data-label="推进方向">地下城5层遭遇</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-ember.html">Ember</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">21:00–03:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">坚韧</td><td data-label="推进方向">地下城50层遭遇</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-momosagi.html">Momosagi</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">08:00–22:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">欲望无尽</td><td data-label="推进方向">地下城个人情境；玩家驯服20+</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-sashimi.html">Sashimi</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">15:00–17:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">海妖之歌</td><td data-label="推进方向">水池个人路线；她自己的水流</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-maize.html">Maize</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">09:00–17:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">芳心杀手</td><td data-label="推进方向">35层起的斗士公会悬赏遭遇</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-pepper.html">Pepper</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">00:00–24:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">兔跳</td><td data-label="推进方向">复活节奖励及初见</td></tr><tr><th scope="row"><a href="character-ryia.html">Ryia</a></th><td data-label="普通工作时段">10:00–18:00</td><td data-label="固有被动">完美记忆</td><td data-label="推进方向">农民小屋个人路线及招募</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><p>固有工作效果各有范围：收入类增加个人工资5%；快速学习、完美记忆、采矿、自适应学习增加1工作经验；压力类防止1点工作压力；表演大师、杂技、专注、海妖之歌增加3个百分点双倍工资概率；组织者／园艺师清洁2；欲望无尽增加1客户；神谕者／女王增加1每日声誉。六项服务岗位被动解释已有房间效果，不会重复多送一份。精确顺序见<a href="game-systems-brothel-stats-and-calculations.html#zh-passives">计算参考</a>。</p><p>Poppy、Blinky、Sherry、Azariel、Esperanza和Muramasa属于服务负责人或住客，不是额外的普通员工条目。六名女仆与已捕获魔物也各用独立管理系统。</p>
<figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 1085px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：员工管理分别显示生命、忠诚度、压力、经验、属性和固有被动。图中两名早期员工的数值仅为示例。" href="../assets/images/wiki/brothel-guide/zh-worker-management-full.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="员工管理分别显示生命、忠诚度、压力、经验、属性和固有被动。图中两名早期员工的数值仅为示例。" decoding="async" height="215" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/brothel-guide/zh-worker-management.webp" width="1085"/></a><figcaption>员工管理分别显示生命、忠诚度、压力、经验、属性和固有被动。图中两名早期员工的数值仅为示例。</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="zh-bedrooms"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Worker_Bedroom_Intimate_Plots"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Room_Service_.E2.80.94_Poppy.27s_Signature_Offering"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Room_Service_—_Poppy's_Signature_Offering"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kitchen_.26_Room_Service"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Kitchen_&amp;_Room_Service"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Service_Room_Apprenticeship_Effects"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-How_to_unlock_the_Specialty_Rooms"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Specialty_Rooms"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Upgrading_workers.27_rooms_and_their_effects"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Upgrading_workers'_rooms_and_their_effects"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Room_Management_Screen"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Workers_Rooms_.26_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Workers_Rooms_&amp;_Upgrades"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Workers.27_Room"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Workers'_Room"></span>
<h2>升级员工卧室</h2>
<p>在<strong>员工宿舍 → 管理房间</strong>中，点击员工卧室格子的升级按钮。卧室从1级起，最高5级。每行都是升到该级需额外支付的费用。<strong>C／R／E分别表示普通／稀有／史诗</strong>；材料、布料、原料要分别支付。升级卧室本身不推进时间。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">目标等级</th><th scope="col">金币</th><th scope="col">材料</th><th scope="col">布料</th><th scope="col">原料</th><th scope="col">工资上限／每日声誉／客户</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="金币">$1,000</td><td data-label="材料">20C+5R</td><td data-label="布料">10C</td><td data-label="原料">5C</td><td data-label="工资上限／每日声誉／客户">×1.10 / +1 / +0</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="材料">40C+10R</td><td data-label="布料">20C+5R</td><td data-label="原料">15C+3R</td><td data-label="工资上限／每日声誉／客户">×1.25 / +3 / +1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="金币">$25,000</td><td data-label="材料">25R+5E</td><td data-label="布料">15R+3E</td><td data-label="原料">10R+2E</td><td data-label="工资上限／每日声誉／客户">×1.40 / +5 / +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="金币">$100,000</td><td data-label="材料">15E</td><td data-label="布料">10E</td><td data-label="原料">8E</td><td data-label="工资上限／每日声誉／客户">×1.60 / +7 / +3</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>效果按当前等级取值，不是把每一行继续相加。声誉是每日固定贡献，不会永久增加名气。30间卧室全到5级，理论上可在全店倍率前贡献210每日声誉，但只有实际工作的员工才贡献当天这部分。额外客户也会增加脏乱，通常还增加工作压力。</p><p>服务房间的学徒等级是另一回事，通常等于开放基础等级加学徒人数，不需要寻找旧的付费服务房间升级阶梯。维护费按计费房间每级$20计算，也包括所有已定义员工卧室；大规模扩建前可看<a href="game-systems-brothel-stats-and-calculations.html#zh-building-income">维护费公式</a>。</p>
<figure class="reviewed-screenshot"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：员工卧室付费升级，与服务房间安排学徒，使用不同控件。房间和资源仅为示例。" href="../assets/images/wiki/brothel-guide/zh-room-management.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="员工卧室付费升级，与服务房间安排学徒，使用不同控件。房间和资源仅为示例。" decoding="async" height="720" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/brothel-guide/zh-room-management.webp" width="1280"/></a><figcaption>员工卧室付费升级，与服务房间安排学徒，使用不同控件。房间和资源仅为示例。</figcaption></figure></section>
<section id="zh-apprentices"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Apprenticeship_Strategy_2"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Elara_as_an_Apprentice_Master"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Apprenticeship_Strategy"></span>
<h2>安排学徒与服务房间</h2>
<p>在<strong>管理房间</strong>中点击服务格子，选择可用员工，需释放名额时点<strong>移除</strong>。多数房间可放<strong>3名学徒</strong>，舞厅只有<strong>1名学员</strong>。员工须已启用、未在别处任学徒、未休假。员工负责人Elara、Raven、Valkyra、Willow、Vixen不能当学徒。普通学徒仍可接待客户并赚钱，只有明确替代工作的房间例外。</p><details><summary>房间开放、效果与代价</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">房间</th><th scope="col">开放条件</th><th scope="col">效果</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">主卧</th><td data-label="开放条件">起始房间</td><td data-label="效果">学徒工作经验+50%，每日工作／事件不增加压力</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Elara的办公室</th><td data-label="开放条件">起始房间</td><td data-label="效果">每名学徒使全店收入、声誉各+5%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">女仆宿舍</th><td data-label="开放条件">获得任意一名女仆</td><td data-label="效果">每名学徒使团队清洁量+10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">医务室</th><td data-label="开放条件">招募Willow</td><td data-label="效果">Willow启用时工作压力基数7、病休3天；学徒防止新增工作压力</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">安保</th><td data-label="开放条件">招募Valkyra</td><td data-label="效果">每日事件成功率+8个百分点，每学徒再+5点，最终概率最高95%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">地牢</th><td data-label="开放条件">招募Raven</td><td data-label="效果">学徒压力不增加、忠诚度不下降，训练压力0</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">酒吧</th><td data-label="开放条件">招募Brandy；相关路线需声誉8+</td><td data-label="效果">全店收入／声誉+5%，脏乱+10；每学徒再+1%、脏乱+1，并为本人增加2客户</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">厨房</th><td data-label="开放条件">声誉4+后Poppy抵达</td><td data-label="效果">每学徒给全店随机分配1客户，并强化客房服务</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">奥术房</th><td data-label="开放条件">声誉7+后Blinky抵达</td><td data-label="效果">每学徒增加1有效装饰等级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">密室</th><td data-label="开放条件">Azariel的特殊开放方式</td><td data-label="效果">每学徒使所有实际工作员工的工作经验+1</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">珍兽苑</th><td data-label="开放条件">Gastoff建造；声誉9+</td><td data-label="效果">每学徒增加1有效宣传等级</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">VIP休息室</th><td data-label="开放条件">招募Vixen；相关路线需声誉10+</td><td data-label="效果">Vixen和学徒各客户+1、个人工资×2、脏乱×2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Esperanza的舞厅</th><td data-label="开放条件">相关开放剧情；声誉7+、Esperanza朋友、Elara已知</td><td data-label="效果">限1名学员，以训练经验替代工作，声誉+10%，扣普通净利15%</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">训练室</th><td data-label="开放条件">建房后完成Muramasa的相关招募剧情</td><td data-label="效果">0／1–2／3学徒时玩家属性增益为2–5／2–6／3–7；2人起耗时降为100分钟</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><p>前期办公室能同时提升收入与声誉；人数增加后，医务室减压更有价值，医疗等级还可继续强化防护。主卧主要保护<em>每日</em>压力，地牢还保护训练压力和忠诚度。VIP脏乱翻倍，舞厅学员则放弃普通收入并收取费用。岗位也可能增加维护费，应按当前真正遇到的问题安排。</p>
</section>
<section id="zh-clothing"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Two_Ways_to_Upgrade_Clothing"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Clothing_Levels_.281.E2.80.936.29"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Clothing_Levels_(1–6)"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Workers_Clothing_.26_Items"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Workers_Clothing_&amp;_Items"></span>
<h2>服装等级与Fernando试衣</h2>
<p>员工服装从1级起，最高6级。服装改善每日工资范围，并在1–6级分别增加0／1／2／3／4／5固定每日声誉。最后一级要在Fernando的裁缝店选择独立的<strong>员工服装升至MAX</strong>，不是普通试衣。</p><p>Fernando的<strong>员工服装</strong>与<strong>员工服装升至MAX</strong>共用<strong>每天1次</strong>机会，开放<strong>06:00–20:59</strong>，耗时<strong>30分钟</strong>，从符合条件的启用员工中随机挑选。5级以下，每名员工最多接受<strong>两次普通升级</strong>；达到5级后，即使已用过前两次，也能接受最后的MAX试衣。</p><p>普通试衣按全店共用价格阶梯计费：起价<strong>$300及普通／稀有／史诗布料10／5／1</strong>，每次完成后提高一档，最高第50档<strong>$500,000及250／150／99布料</strong>。MAX费用是<strong>当前档位的两倍</strong>，但最低为<strong>$5,000及100／50／25布料</strong>，也会推进共用价格档。无法指定随机选中的员工。</p><p>独立的<strong>客人的谢意</strong>后续可免费提升符合条件的在岗员工服装，但最多到5级。报告提到客人要答谢时，可回入口查看；它不占Fernando次数，也不提高他的价格档。青楼模式检查魅力与外貌，酒店模式检查魅力与智力，不依赖NTS预约开关。</p><details><summary>完整50档普通／MAX报价</summary><p>布料栏按普通／稀有／史诗排列。下一档取决于累计试衣次数，不取决于该员工当前服装等级。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">档位</th><th scope="col">普通金币</th><th scope="col">普通布料</th><th scope="col">MAX金币</th><th scope="col">MAX布料</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">1</th><td data-label="普通金币">$300</td><td data-label="普通布料">10/5/1</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">100/50/25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">2</th><td data-label="普通金币">$350</td><td data-label="普通布料">15/7/2</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">100/50/25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">3</th><td data-label="普通金币">$400</td><td data-label="普通布料">25/10/3</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">100/50/25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">4</th><td data-label="普通金币">$500</td><td data-label="普通布料">32/13/4</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">100/50/25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">5</th><td data-label="普通金币">$550</td><td data-label="普通布料">40/16/5</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">100/50/25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">6</th><td data-label="普通金币">$600</td><td data-label="普通布料">46/20/6</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">100/50/25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">7</th><td data-label="普通金币">$700</td><td data-label="普通布料">52/24/7</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">104/50/25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">8</th><td data-label="普通金币">$900</td><td data-label="普通布料">58/27/8</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">116/54/25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">9</th><td data-label="普通金币">$1,000</td><td data-label="普通布料">64/31/9</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">128/62/25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">10</th><td data-label="普通金币">$1,200</td><td data-label="普通布料">70/35/10</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">140/70/25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">11</th><td data-label="普通金币">$1,400</td><td data-label="普通布料">76/39/12</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">152/78/25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">12</th><td data-label="普通金币">$1,600</td><td data-label="普通布料">82/43/14</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">164/86/28</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">13</th><td data-label="普通金币">$1,800</td><td data-label="普通布料">88/47/16</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">176/94/32</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">14</th><td data-label="普通金币">$2,100</td><td data-label="普通布料">94/51/18</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">188/102/36</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">15</th><td data-label="普通金币">$2,500</td><td data-label="普通布料">100/55/20</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,000</td><td data-label="MAX布料">200/110/40</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">16</th><td data-label="普通金币">$2,900</td><td data-label="普通布料">106/59/23</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$5,800</td><td data-label="MAX布料">212/118/46</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">17</th><td data-label="普通金币">$3,400</td><td data-label="普通布料">112/63/26</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$6,800</td><td data-label="MAX布料">224/126/52</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">18</th><td data-label="普通金币">$3,900</td><td data-label="普通布料">118/67/29</td><td data-label="MAX金币">$7,800</td><td data-label="MAX布料">